<title>SINGAPORE: Philippines awards Oct/Nov fuel oil at $14-$15/t.</title>
<headline>Philippines awards Oct/Nov fuel oil at $14-$15/t.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Petron Corp has awarded its tender to buy 200,000 barrels of fuel oil for October 26-30 or November 10-14 delivery at $14-$15 per tonne over Singapore spot quotes on a cost-and-freight basis, industry sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 1.0 percent sulphur grade fuel oil will be delivered to Bataan.</p>
<p>The tender had closed on October 9 and was valid for one-day.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082).</p>
</text>
